,"body":"Discarding changes is indeed intended and is now documented.\r\n\r\nI've fiddled a bit more with this and discovered that sometimes when doing redundant `close_scene()` while having other scene open prior to running the script from PR post, there's this error:\r\n\r\n`ERROR: core\\object\\message_queue.cpp:222 - Error calling deferred method: 'EditorNode::EditorNode::_set_main_scene_state': Cannot convert argument 2 from Object to Object.`\r\n\r\nI've looked at it through the debugger and it happens when the 2nd param is `NULL`. I'd like to investigate it further but at the moment I'm not sure how. Any ideas would be helpful.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105502#pullrequestreview-2837017056","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105502","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105502#pullrequestreview-2837017056"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105502"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-13T16:22:58Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2865539577,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6qzKn5","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","receive